@startuml structuralDiagram

'separate diagram for main menu? i.e. settings leaderboard'

'participants: player, room, engine, goose'
'sequence diagram - mainly decisions'

actor Player #Red
participant Engine
participant Room
participant Enemy
participant Item
participant Obstacle
participant Timer


'start of the game'

Player -> Engine: Start game
Engine -> Timer: Start 5 Min timer
Timer -> Engine: Render timer


'creation of the maze

Engine -> Enemy: Initialise enemies
Engine -> Item: Initialise game obstacles
Engine -> Player: Initialise full energy
Engine -> Energy: Render energy bar

'timer:'

loop Timer != 0
    Timer -> Timer: Reduce timer by 1 second
end

alt Timer = 0
    Timer -> Engine: Display game over screen
    Engine -> Engine: Stop processing inputs
    Engine -> Player: Return Player to Main Menu
end

alt Time <= 60 second
    Timer -> Timer: Change timer colour to red
    Engine -> Engine: Alert player with sound effect
end


'goose (enemy):'

alt Player close to Enemy
    Enemy -> Engine: Detect player location
    Engine -> Player: Lose energy
    Engine -> Player: Decrease speed

else Player has duck food
    Player -> Engine: Duck food in Player's hotbar
    Engine -> Enemy: Ignore player
    Enemy -> Player: No impact

end


'energy system'

Engine -> Player: Gradually reduce energy

alt energy <= threshold:
    Engine -> Player: Player movement speed reduced

end


'player movement:'

Player -> Engine: Player chooses direction
Engine -> Obstacle: Checks if there's an obstacle

alt Obstacle in front of player
    Obstacle -> Engine: Player can't pass through
    Engine -> Player: Player stops

else No Obstacle
    Engine -> Player: Player continues as normal

end


'rooms/doors

Engine -> Room: Check room is unlocked

alt Room is unlocked
    Engine -> Player: Enter room

else Room is locked
    Engine -> Player: Cannot enter, need key
    Engine -> Player: Hint where key is

end


'items:'

Item -> Engine: Place items on the floor/map
Engine -> Player: Make items interactable/visible

Player -> Engine: Interact with Item

alt Item is key/LongBoi
    Engine -> Player: Player sees Item in their hotbar

else Item is food/drink
    Engine -> Item: Player consumes the item
    Item -> Engine: Remove item from the map
    Engine -> Player: Energy bar increases

end


'player wins the game (longboi is returned and make the bus):'

alt Player has LongBoi and Time != 0
    Player -> Engine: Reach exit (bus)
    Engine -> Player: Display that the player has won and show score

else Player doesn't have LongBoi or time = 0
    Engine -> Player: Game over


@enduml
